        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLIC7gRQv4_ipGNlBTDI-XxvOjj8px1eZ0xQ-Aw5NrUpv5SLROl=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Richard did great work on my 2008 Mercedes. His price was fair, it was actually a little better than other places that I had quoted. The work that needed to get done was rust on both rear quarter panels/wheel wells, some small rust touch ups on both rear doors, and repairing a dented rear bumper. He did not simply grind down the rust and repaint. He cut out all the rust, welding in galvanized steel and filled and repainted.  The paint had no orange peel effect, was color matched perfectly, and had no runs or bubbles ... This was a professional job. Richard was nice to work with, easy to get in contact with and he was flexible for meeting and arranging payment. I would get work done by him again and I would recomend.",
        "time": 1634404761,
