        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXPOjYq5yFe7gHVV-3xuo84xFY5ouslmcEM3yqc7Nm5i6VJ69ZKCg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "7 years ago",
        "text": "Well, they didn't do anything, but they didn't ask me for any money... I guess this is to make up for it...\nI'm going to be able to tell you whether or not this body shop is honest. They did a horrible job on my son's vehicle, and they're supposed to have fixed everything in August 2018.\nThey're making me doubt them because they're questioning my word, which is completely unacceptable.\nLots of paint spots on the right rear door and they added a new dent to the roof. Plus, the roofline demarcation is horrible, and then they told me that for $100 more they could have done the entire roof...\nDisappointed so far, but we'll see in August!\nWell, I say no.\nDon't go there.\nEven some of the door seals aren't sealed, and you can't stain the ceiling light...",
